      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْقَمَ</span></b> , [inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْقَمَةٌ</span>,] said of the colocynth, <i>It attained its utmost degree of bitterness.</i>
